tras/d0092abaf16323b03bd27191d5718314.poster.avif?t=1755456339\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/d0092abaf16323b03bd27191d5718314.webm?t=1755456339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/d0092abaf16323b03bd27191d5718314.mp4?t=1755456339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in city N in an alternative 1990s. You play as Anton, a leading engineer of rods energy technology \u2014 a unique technology experiencing a revival after a period of decline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City N is a place where the fates of ordinary people intertwine with the interests of influential figures. Here, everyone tries to survive by their own rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/2cd852304b963b087e7b06d589304cfc.poster.avif?t=1755456339\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/2cd852304b963b087e7b06d589304cfc.webm?t=1755456339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652160/extras/2cd852304b963b087e7b06d589304cfc.mp4?t=1755456339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
